{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8134ea6f-420a-8b70-b0b4-1415fb8b007c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T11:42:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Before anything, may I have your name again? I want to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's Owen. O-W-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Owen. Okay. And this is the right office for a noise complaint? I've been bounced around already [inaudible]."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can take the report here and get it to the right people. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a bar with music going every night since Monday. I can hear it blocks away. Blocks. The bass comes right through my walls, and I'm tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Since Monday, so that's three nights now. Let me get this down. What's the location you're calling about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 4 Ocean Avenue. The bar is down the road from me, but that's where I'm hearing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four Ocean Avenue. Got it. Do you know the name of the bar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not guess at the name. It's the one near the corner, with the patio. [line breaks up] ... which ward is that in? Is there a ward person I should call about this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up a bit. Did you say word?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ward. W-A-R-D. Which ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, ward. Okay. I'd have to look that up for your address. It doesn't change who takes the report, though. I'm writing it up now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I thought you said word, like a word with them. Never mind. Go ahead, I'm writing each step down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. So, loud amplified music from a bar, audible blocks away, nightly since Monday, reported from 4 Ocean Avenue. Does it run late?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Past eleven, every night. Last night close to midnight. I'm sick of it, honestly. This should not be happening three nights running."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Can I get a callback number in case someone needs to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-five. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And your name was Owen, and what do I tell them if I call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:41:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tell them you spoke with Owen in the City Clerk's office on Wednesday about the music complaint. It'll go to the people who handle licensing and enforcement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:42:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wednesday, Owen, music complaint. Okay. I'd like someone to actually do something this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. The report's in. If it continues tonight, call again so it's logged for tonight too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T11:42:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
